      "• More concrete revenue validation: Specifies a threshold (>5 data fields) for tiered pricing and proposes feedback from 3 specific nonprofit types (large NGO, mid-sized charity, small local org).",
      "• Same thoughtful differentiation and expansion validation plans as Project A.",
      "• Clear privacy-first delivery model that avoids storing sensitive data."
